# Internal operational documentation lives in the private repo
# clawless-io/clawdemy-internal — not in the public repo.
# These local symlinks point at sibling working copy of that private repo.
# Per the strict need-to-know principle locked in private decisions log.
CLAUDE.md
HANDOVER.md
Doc
Doc/
drafts
drafts/

# Playwright artifacts
test-results/
playwright-report/
playwright/.cache/
.playwright-mcp/

# Read-along trial: local working directory holds the source MP3 used for
# WhisperX alignment plus the raw whisperx output JSON. The PUBLIC timing
# JSON (committed at public/read-along/<slug>.timing.json) is the artifact
# the trial component reads at runtime.
.read-along-trial/

# Generated audio: regenerated from lesson MDX via scripts/generate-audio.ts.
# Master files will live in R2 once Phase 9.5 ships; for now we do not bloat
# the repo with binary MP3s that change every time a lesson is edited.
public/audio/

# MCP server configuration: local agent-link config, not part of the site.
.mcp.json
